<title>USA: Northrop Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Northrop Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.30		    $1.17</p>
<p> Net			 17,000		   58,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,282,000		1,812,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  57,780		   49,438</p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $4.33		    $5.11</p>
<p> Net			234,000		  252,000</p>
<p> Revs		  10,524,000		4,592,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  54,011		   49,363</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Year ended Dec. 31, 1996 included a pretax charge of $90 million, or $1.07 a share, related to the plant closures, and a pretax gain of $28 million, or 34 cents a share, from the sale of shares in ETEC Systems Inc.</p>
<p>Latest quarter included a plant closure charge of $90 million, or $1 a share, and a pretax gain of $10 million, or 12 cents a share, from the sale of ETEC shares. The difference between the plant closure per share amount for the fourth quarter and full year 1996 is due to the issuance of an additional 8,050,000 shares in June 1996.</p>
</text>
